{"id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-4-axiom.md","title":"Axiom 4","display":"df-4-axiom — Axiom 4","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-4-axiom","aliases":["89-df-4-axiom"],"display":"df-4-axiom — Axiom 4","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-4-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-4-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-4-axiom — Axiom 4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-4-axiom-—-Axiom-4-(Positive-Introspection)\">df-4-axiom — Axiom 4 (Positive Introspection)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are the\nconstructors fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a> and\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{4}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\)</span> 是公理 4 的全部代入实例。</li>\n<li>&quot;若我知道<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则我知道我知道<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>&quot;</li>\n<li>对应传递框架性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-4-axiom-—-Axiom-4-(Positive-Introspection)","text":"df-4-axiom — Axiom 4 (Positive Introspection)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nconstructors fixed in [[89-df-box-modality]] and\n[[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nconstructors fixed in [[89-df-box-modality]] and\n[[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{4}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":828,"backlinks":[{"id":"9b21eea801049233","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-4-axiom]])."},{"id":"568df5609e652c40","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-4-axiom]])."},{"id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-18",